<title>TURKEY: Turkish markets closed Friday due to national day.</title>
<headline>Turkish markets closed Friday due to national day.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish markets, government offices and banks will be closed on Friday, the national Victory Day.</p>
<p>They will re-open on Monday.</p>
</text>
